      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_5f4fd333",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: weed_man_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme uses a photo of a Black man, likely intended to be associated with a stereotype of being a 'weed man' (a slang term for someone who deals or uses marijuana), and juxtaposes it with the text 'when the weed man throw in a little extra.' This implies a stereotype that Black people are dishonest or greedy, particularly in the context of drug dealing. The image and text together create a harmful and hateful caricature that reinforces negative racial stereotypes, specifically targeting Black individuals with a derogatory association to criminal behavior and greed. The meme's intent is to demean and stereotype a racial group based on a false and offensive assumption.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_cd7e6cab"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
