      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Criminal Behavior Associations",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are inherently associated with criminal behavior, particularly drug dealing, which is a longstanding and harmful racial trope. This stereotype is used to imply that the man in the image (a Black man) is dishonest or greedy when 'throwing in a little extra' in the context of drug dealing.",
