      "label": "Slang Term: 'Weed Man'",
      "description": "The term 'weed man' is a slang term used to refer to someone who deals or uses marijuana. In this meme, it is used to label the man as a drug dealer, which is a derogatory and stereotypical association. This term is not a formal or respectful descriptor and is used here to reinforce a negative racial stereotype.",
